From b5b49cc054fd7e2f0f919a27952c72b36f6eb708 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Michal Wilczynski <m.wilczynski@samsung.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 12:31:02 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 05/37] dt-bindings: soc: starfive: Add
 starfive,jh7110-vout-syscon

The video output subsystem has its own system controller, documented as
dom_vout_syscon. Among other things it holds the mux that selects which
DC8200 output drives the HDMI transmitter, so the HDMI controller needs
to reach it.

Acked-by: Krzysztof Kozlowski <krzysztof.kozlowski@oss.qualcomm.com>
Signed-off-by: Michal Wilczynski <m.wilczynski@samsung.com>
(cherry picked from commit f744e43146b0b78857a6ee36420ef2c4a04adc9c)
Upstream-Status: Submitted [v3 https://ratatoskr.run/dri-devel/2026/09/17514319/t (JH7110 display subsystem series, 2026-09-04); from https://github.com/domibel/linux branch jh7110_dc8200_hdmi_v7.3-rc5]

---
 .../devicetree/bindings/soc/starfive/starfive,jh7110-syscon.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/starfive/starfive,jh7110-syscon.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/starfive/starfive,jh7110-syscon.yaml
index 0039319e91fe..cf9b657d0e8a 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/starfive/starfive,jh7110-syscon.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/starfive/starfive,jh7110-syscon.yaml
@@ -24,6 +24,7 @@ properties:
           - enum:
               - starfive,jh7110-aon-syscon
               - starfive,jh7110-stg-syscon
+              - starfive,jh7110-vout-syscon
           - const: syscon
 
   reg:
